*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 1008HS-100
* Inductance = 10nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-6.7GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 1008HS-100 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.065pF Ind=9.8nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=8
+ R2=0.1
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000196
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 1008HS-100

